      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "ceridwen",
      "description": "Cwm Badau/Bay of boats, Abercastle Looking out to sea: mostly pleasure crafts but some fishing still goes on from the protection of this tidal haven. Although a deeply-indented inlet, the sea is shallow and ships had only a 6-hour turn-around time for loading and unloading (using horses and carts) at high tide.",
      "dateCreated": "2008-08-10",
      "sourceType": "commons-category",
      "sourceArticleId": "abercastle-wp",
